## Part 1 — Learn the concepts (20 minutes)

### 0–5 minutes: What is prompt engineering?

Prompt engineering is the practice of designing instructions and context to guide an LLM toward a desired response. Clear instructions and explicit output formats often improve results.&#x20;

[image](https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=https://huggingface.co\&sz=32)

