## 🛠️ Debugging tips

- Model download fails: Check your internet connection and retry.
- `ModuleNotFoundError`: Run the installation cell again.
- Unexpected category: Inspect the exact generated text; models may return extra words.
- Slow generation: Start with short prompts and small output limits.
- Poor accuracy: Improve your instructions, test different examples, and inspect ambiguous cases.

